(7514285, 1199776, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very nice Mark. Congrats on TT. I hiked up that tallest mountain to the left. If I remember right, it took 8 hours and was about 5000 elevation gain. Halfway up, the trail turned into a very primitive trail, very steep and I remember pulling myself up the mountain by tree trunks at times. Nice view from the summit. Looks like the glacier has receded a lot since I was there in 2000.</td>', 'Very nice Mark. Congrats on TT. I hiked up that tallest mountain to the left. If I remember right, it took 8 hours and was about 5000 elevation gain. Halfway up, the trail turned into a very primitive trail, very steep and I remember pulling myself up the mountain by tree trunks at times. Nice view from the summit. Looks like the glacier has receded a lot since I was there in 2000.', '2017-05-17 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7514286, 1199604, 12611, '<td valign="top">The Rust colored trees are perfect against the emerald greens. Congrats Again!</td>', 'The Rust colored trees are perfect against the emerald greens. Congrats Again!', '2017-05-17 11:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
