(7514299, 1199794, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think it might be easy to have tunnel vision on this one, but I like the peripherals, and how the details on the edges are the true focus, and just out of reach. Perhaps I am thinking into things too deeply, but this is allegorical for the construct "it is in the journey, not the destination"</td>', 'I think it might be easy to have tunnel vision on this one, but I like the peripherals, and how the details on the edges are the true focus, and just out of reach. Perhaps I am thinking into things too deeply, but this is allegorical for the construct "it is in the journey, not the destination"', '2017-05-17 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 0),
